sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor AD as Backoffice Admin
    participant G as Gateway
    participant A as auth-service
    participant B as RabbitMQ
    participant T as text-channel
    participant P as profile-worker
    participant U as Cliente suspendido

    AD->>G: PATCH /api/admin/accounts/42/status
    G->>A: PATCH /account/42/status + X-User-Id
    A->>A: marca la cuenta SUSPENDED
    A->>A: revoca todos los refresh tokens
    A-->>G: revoked_session_ids
    G->>G: los suma a la lista de revocación
    A->>B: AccountSuspended (account_events)
    B-->>T: fan-out a la cola de cada réplica
    B-->>P: AccountSuspended
    P->>P: oculta el perfil
    T-->>U: frame session_ended
    T-xU: cierra todas sus WebSockets